{"sourceId":"thinksr","title":"ThinkSR: compact thought, dense output","lang":"en","scenes":[{"id":"s01-flow","intent":"Show the ThinkSR method flow with recurrence confined to the thought stage.","claim":"ThinkSR keeps a dense carrier while a compact thought process updates it repeatedly.","narration":"The low-resolution image is first encoded into features that keep the spatial detail needed for super-resolution. The feature field is partitioned into windows, but the tokens remain dense rather than collapsed into one thought. DQ-CTM reads and updates each window through repeated ticks, with parameters shared across those ticks. The recurrence belongs inside the thought stage itself, and the decoder converts the updated dense carrier into the output image.","evidence":[{"kind":"section","id":"sec2"},{"kind":"figure","id":"fig-arch"}],"weight":0.9,"seconds":8.6,"objects":[{"id":"s01-title","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.5,"y":0.12},"size":null,"text":"ThinkSR updates dense features with compact thought.","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":76,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":1},{"id":"s01-img","kind":"rect","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.13,"y":0.52},"size":{"w":0.13,"h":0.2},"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":"muted","fill":"surface","opacity":0},{"id":"s01-img-label","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.13,"y":0.69},"size":null,"text":"Low-res image","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":44,"tone":"muted","fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"s01-encode","kind":"rect","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.32,"y":0.52},"size":{"w":0.15,"h":0.16},"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":"a","fill":"tone","opacity":0},{"id":"s01-encode-label","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.32,"y":0.52},"size":null,"text":"Encode","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":50,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"s01-a1","kind":"arrow","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.225,"y":0.52},"si